From: 1alecthenice1 <188545014+1alecthenice1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 02:51:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rango: Keep MoseyApp's original signature

MoseyApp (com.google.android.mosey, the Quick Share extension) calls
Google Play services' Nearby Share API, which only serves Google-signed
callers. Without ;PRESIGNED it is re-signed with the platform key, and
every call fails with "SecurityException: Denied access to unsuspend
method" -> the app crash-loops (every ~12 s on a running device) and
Quick Share sessions using it drop.
---
 rango/proprietary-files.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/rango/proprietary-files.txt b/rango/proprietary-files.txt
index 333cd02..dd328fd 100644
--- a/rango/proprietary-files.txt
+++ b/rango/proprietary-files.txt
@@ -177,7 +177,7 @@ system_ext/etc/init/mosey.rc
 system_ext/etc/permissions/privapp-permissions-com.google.android.mosey.xml
 system_ext/etc/vintf/manifest/manifest_mosey.xml
 system_ext/lib64/libmosey_daemon_ffi.so
-system_ext/priv-app/MoseyApp/MoseyApp.apk
+system_ext/priv-app/MoseyApp/MoseyApp.apk;PRESIGNED
 
 # Radio
 system_ext/etc/default-permissions/default-permissions-euiccpixel.xml
-- 
2.51.2

